{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A cozy Pomodoro timer that gently keeps you on track.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Stay on track. Literally.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848970/extras/44dff9bef995b535dfa7dd1cfa6c59eb.poster.avif?t=1774610495\" width=408 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848970/extras/44dff9bef995b535dfa7dd1cfa6c59eb.webm?t=1774610495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848970/extras/44dff9bef995b535dfa7dd1cfa6c59eb.mp4?t=1774610495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >PomoExpress turns your focus sessions into tranquil train rides. Watch the scenery roll by as you work, rest, and repeat.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>All Pomodoro Cycles Covered</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848970/extras/9538358394bda81f79205d40ca6ad7ec.poster.avif?t=1774610495\" width=408 height=266 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848970/extras/9538358394bda81f79205d40ca6ad7ec.webm?t=1774610495\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3848970/extras/9538358394bda81f79205d40ca6ad7ec.mp4?t=1774610495\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes focus sessions, short breaks, and long breaks.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Work to Collect</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new trains, carriages, and scenic backdrops simply by staying focused.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Track Your Progress</s